         </table><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:3pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(1)	Inclusive of recreation and strategic partnership loans held for sale, at lower of amortized cost or fair value.</span></p><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(2)	Excludes deferred financing costs of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">$</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_70f41a75-cffd-41cd-9b91-380bf97d8e16" contextRef="C_56f67490-b274-4c99-bd85-166fd122e13b" name="us-gaap:DeferredFinanceCostsNet" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">8.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> as of December 31, 2025.</span></p><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(3)	Allowance for credit loss as a percent of gross loans held for investment and excludes loans held for sale.</span></p><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(4)	Loans 90 days or more past due as a percent of total gross loans.</span></p><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(5)	Net charge-offs as a percent of annual average gross loans</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">. Charge-off ratio in the recreation lending segment was </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_19490762-bf86-4a5b-bb44-84ffb68ca39f" contextRef="C_6c159ea5-9c09-46d9-8d3d-f1f252d74dd4" name="mfin:ChargeoffsToLoansPercentage" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3.95</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% when excluding loans held for sale.</span></p><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(NM)	Not meaningful.</span></p><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(*)	Line item is not applicable to segments.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></ix:continuation></div></ix:continuation></div></div>
