tent;"> as of December 31, 2024.</span></p><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(3)	</span><ix:footnote id="FNT_0c7821d7-8b48-4e58-800b-1c8192658167" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Allowance for credit loss </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">as a percent of gross loans held for investment and excludes loans held for sale.</span></ix:footnote></p><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(4)	</span><ix:footnote id="FNT_1ee89005-b248-4dd9-87ab-7fa7332950fa" xml:lang="en-US" continuedAt="F_1ee89005-b248-4dd9-87ab-7fa7332950fa_1"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Loans </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">90 days or more past due as a percent of total gross loans.</span></ix:footnote></p><ix:continuation id="F_1ee89005-b248-4dd9-87ab-7fa7332950fa_1"><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(5)	Net charge-offs as a percent of annual average gross loans</span><span s